{%- comment -%}
  Renders a `published` value from _data (writing.yml, media_page.yml), which
  is either a full ISO date (YAML parses it as a Date) or a quoted month-
  precision "YYYY-MM" string for sources that give only a month. Liquid's
  `date` filter cannot parse "YYYY-MM", so pad it to the first of the month
  first. Only pass formats without a day (e.g. "%Y", "%B %Y"), or a month-
  precision value would print a day the source never gave.
  Usage: {% include pub-date.liquid date=item.published format="%Y" %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign pub_date_value = include.date -%}
{%- if pub_date_value.size == 7 -%}
  {%- assign pub_date_value = pub_date_value | append: '-01' -%}
{%- endif -%}
{{- pub_date_value | date: include.format -}}
